WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.090
This week's words are the ones a historian uses with care:

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:10.620
claim, evidence, reasoning, treaty, removal, nation.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:14.440
Then formal style, the way an essay talks.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:19.490
In the game, peel the husks off a long word to find the base word inside.
